Package: datasets-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python-pip, python-pyarrow, python-pandas, python-numpy
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: HuggingFace Datasets for Termux - training data management
 Load, stream and cache ML datasets. apt installs pyarrow (prebuilt),
 pandas and numpy; the install step pip-installs datasets and its
 small pure-Python deps (xxhash has Android wheels). No Rust builds.
 Commands: datasets-check, datasets-setup. Set DATASETS_SKIP_SETUP=1
 during apt install to skip the setup (run datasets-setup later).
